Solution:

1. Download the challenge archive:
   
   wget https://hubchallenges.s3.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/Crypto/RSA101.zip

2. Extract the archive:
   
   unzip RSA101.zip

3. Locate the encrypted file cipher and the private key key.pem.

4. Decrypt the cipher using OpenSSL:
   
   openssl pkeyutl -decrypt -in cipher -out flag.txt -inkey key.pem

5. Read the decrypted output:
   
   cat flag.txt

6. Retrieve the flag:
   
   flag{RSA_nice_try}
